# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenwrtOpsToolkit —— 版本控制忽略规则
#
# 原则：**源码与文档一律入库**；只排除「设备配置」「凭据」「运行残留」。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- 设备配置（每台设备一份，含节点名/策略组名，绝不入库）---
openwrt/conf/device.conf
**/device.conf
!openwrt/conf/device.conf.example

# --- 凭据 ---
*.key
*.key.orig
*.crt
*.crt.orig
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.env
.env
.env.*
!*.env.example
wg-*.conf
opencode.key

# --- 运行产物与日志 ---
*.log
*.log.*
*.pid
*.sock
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Python 缓存 ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Node（诊断工具里若用到）---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- 文档自检的临时输出 ---
report*.md
REPORT*.md
!docs/**
findings*.json

# --- 本地索引与编辑器 ---
.codegraph/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# --- 本地工作区（临时产物、台账，不入库）---
/.work/
